[
  {
    "idx": 1705,
    "text": "No, go on. Tell me."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1706,
    "text": "Let's save some time."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1707,
    "text": "And so he told me his secret formula for happiness."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1708,
    "text": "Part one of the two part plan"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1709,
    "text": "was that I should just get on with ordinary life,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1710,
    "text": "living it day by day, like anyone else."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1711,
    "text": "This is our current statement with a revised paragraph there, highlighted."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1712,
    "text": "Rupert. Rupert, is that the best you can do?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1713,
    "text": "No. Absolutely not. We can change that."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1714,
    "text": "Item number two."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1715,
    "text": "Good afternoon, sir. Are you eating in or taking away today?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1716,
    "text": "Take away, please."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1717,
    "text": "Yeah? No problem."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1718,
    "text": "Lovely, that's 4.24 then, please, sir. Thank you kindly."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1719,
    "text": "Lovely. And there's your change, sir. 76 pence change."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1720,
    "text": "- Thanks. - Thank you. Hello there."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1721,
    "text": "Are you eating in or taking away?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1722,
    "text": "Do you find the Defendant, John Welbeck, guilty or not guilty of fraud?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1723,
    "text": "Not guilty."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1724,
    "text": "And that is the verdict of you all?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1725,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1726,
    "text": "Thank you. You may be seated."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1727,
    "text": "Thank God."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1728,
    "text": "Let the Defendant be discharged."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1729,
    "text": "Be upstanding in court."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1730,
    "text": "- Lights out? - Yeah."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1731,
    "text": "Tough day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1732,
    "text": "But then came part two of Dad's plan."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1733,
    "text": "He told me to live every day again almost exactly the same."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1734,
    "text": "The first time with all the tensions and worries that"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1735,
    "text": "stop us noticing how sweet the world can be,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1736,
    "text": "but the second time noticing."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1737,
    "text": "Okay, Dad."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1738,
    "text": "Let's give it a go."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1739,
    "text": "What's our statement at the moment?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1740,
    "text": "This is it with the revised..."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1741,
    "text": "Robert, this does not pass. Is this the best you can do?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1742,
    "text": "I'll leave you two to thrash this out."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1743,
    "text": "Ooh."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1744,
    "text": "- Good afternoon, sir. - Good afternoon."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1745,
    "text": "Are you eating in or taking away today?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1746,
    "text": "Take away, please."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1747,
    "text": "Would you like a bag?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1748,
    "text": "That's fine."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1749,
    "text": "Lovely. That's 6.23 then, please."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1750,
    "text": "And enjoy the rest of your day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1751,
    "text": "Thank you. Bye-bye."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1752,
    "text": "Hello, there."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1753,
    "text": "- Look around you! - What?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1754,
    "text": "Isn't this room beautiful?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1755,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1756,
    "text": "Come on."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1757,
    "text": "Not guilty."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1758,
    "text": "Fantastic!"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1759,
    "text": "So not such a bad day after all?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1760,
    "text": "No. It was pretty good really."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1761,
    "text": "Very good day, actually, as it turns out."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1762,
    "text": "Well, that's a relief,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1763,
    "text": "because if it had been a very bad day,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1764,
    "text": "I thought I might have had to have had sex with you to make up for it."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1765,
    "text": "Goodnight."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1766,
    "text": "Mmm."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1767,
    "text": "It was a very, very bad day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1768,
    "text": "It went very, very badly."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1769,
    "text": "I got fired from my job."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1770,
    "text": "And then I killed a man."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1771,
    "text": "That is a very bad day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1772,
    "text": "- It's terrible. - Yeah."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1773,
    "text": "Like the worst day ever."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1774,
    "text": "So sorry."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1775,
    "text": "Some days, of course, though, you only want to go through once."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1776,
    "text": "You okay?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1777,
    "text": "Right, are we ready for this?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1778,
    "text": "'Course we're not. Hateful day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1779,
    "text": "Just give me one minute."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1780,
    "text": "This is so brilliant."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1781,
    "text": "Dickens is so good on actual jokes, actual gags."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1782,
    "text": "Where have you come from?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1783,
    "text": "It's the..."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1784,
    "text": "Oh. Okay."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1785,
    "text": "Big day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1786,
    "text": "Thanks for dropping in. How's Uncle Desmond's suit?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1787,
    "text": "Oh, immaculate."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1788,
    "text": "Excellent."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1789,
    "text": "Did I mention I wanted the Nick Cave track?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1790,
    "text": "It's taken care of."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1791,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1792,
    "text": "Can I just read you this one bit?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1793,
    "text": "Read away, I've got lots of time."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1794,
    "text": "\"I think the Romans must have aggravated"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1795,
    "text": "one another very much with their noses."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1796,
    "text": "Perhaps they became the restless people they were in consequence."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1797,
    "text": "Anyhow, Mr Wopsle's Roman nose so aggravated me...\""
  },
  {
    "idx": 1798,
    "text": "What do you think about the kids?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1799,
    "text": "What about them?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1800,
    "text": "Not many of them, are there?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1801,
    "text": "What?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1802,
    "text": "Well, I mean two?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1803,
    "text": "It's more than the Chinese are allowed."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1804,
    "text": "I just thought that maybe, you know,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1805,
    "text": "it was time for the insurance baby."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1806,
    "text": "What?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1807,
    "text": "In case one of them is really smart,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1808,
    "text": "we don't want the other one to feel stupid their whole life."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1809,
    "text": "And if we had a third one, then we could have two happy dummies."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1810,
    "text": "What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1811,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1812,
    "text": "It was the toughest decision of my life."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1813,
    "text": "Saying 'yes' to the future meant"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1814,
    "text": "saying 'goodbye' to my dad. Forever."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1815,
    "text": "Why don't we wait a bit?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1816,
    "text": "Absolutely."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1817,
    "text": "You're right. Yeah."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1818,
    "text": "How about now?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1819,
    "text": "Or now?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1820,
    "text": "Now?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1821,
    "text": "Yeah,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1822,
    "text": "okay."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1823,
    "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1824,
    "text": "Dad always wished there had been more of us."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1825,
    "text": "So..."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1826,
    "text": "Anyway, we might try and nothing happens."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1827,
    "text": "Exactly."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1828,
    "text": "Really could be tonight."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1829,
    "text": "Mmm. And you cannot believe the detail in which"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1830,
    "text": "I know the route to the hospital."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1831,
    "text": "Oh, yay."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1832,
    "text": "Will you excuse me for a sec?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1833,
    "text": "Just have to go downstairs."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1834,
    "text": "Mmm."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1835,
    "text": "...and it's 17-20 in this incredibly tight contest"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1836,
    "text": "being played by the two most physically"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1837,
    "text": "perfect players in the history of the game."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1838,
    "text": "The crowd, enchanted by the younger player, are seduced"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1839,
    "text": "by memories of the older player's illustrious past."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1840,
    "text": "Ahh!"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1841,
    "text": "Oh, my God, I've won."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1842,
    "text": "I haven't won in years."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1843,
    "text": "You finally got good."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1844,
    "text": "What's my prize? Apart from the Olympic gold medal, of course."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1845,
    "text": "A kiss will have to do."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1846,
    "text": "A kiss?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1847,
    "text": "A kiss?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1848,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1849,
    "text": "Ah, I get you."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1850,
    "text": "This is it, then?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1851,
    "text": "This is it."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1852,
    "text": "It's my last bit of extra time."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1853,
    "text": "The baby is completely on the way."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1854,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1855,
    "text": "Congratulations."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1856,
    "text": "My son."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1857,
    "text": "My dad."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1858,
    "text": "Is there anything at all I can do?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1859,
    "text": "Is there anything you want to do?"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1860,
    "text": "I don't know. There is this"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1861,
    "text": "one thing."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1862,
    "text": "A quick little walk."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1863,
    "text": "Totally against the rules, of course,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1864,
    "text": "but if we don't change a thing,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1865,
    "text": "if we're very careful, it shouldn't do any harm."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1866,
    "text": "It would be nice."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1867,
    "text": "I'm really trying. I'm really trying."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1868,
    "text": "Get down low."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1869,
    "text": "Total defeat."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1870,
    "text": "I'm tired."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1871,
    "text": "Thanks, Dad."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1872,
    "text": "So I'm almost up-to-date with my story."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1873,
    "text": "As all families do, we got used to life after death."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1874,
    "text": "And it was still fine."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1875,
    "text": "And things settled back into their traditional rhythms season after season,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1876,
    "text": "and are much as they have always been."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1877,
    "text": "And we've got used to Kit Kat being happy again."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1878,
    "text": "And then we got used to her being a mum."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1879,
    "text": "Albeit not a very good or even safe one."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1880,
    "text": "And in the end,"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1881,
    "text": "I think I've learned the final lesson from my travels in time."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1882,
    "text": "And I've even gone one step further than my father did."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1883,
    "text": "Okay, I'll do the kids."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1884,
    "text": "No, don't worry. I'll do them."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1885,
    "text": "Yeah, you do them, you lazy bum."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1886,
    "text": "The truth is, I now don't travel back at all. Not even for the day."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1887,
    "text": "I just try to live every day as if"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1888,
    "text": "I've deliberately come back to this one day"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1889,
    "text": "to enjoy it as if it was the full final day"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1890,
    "text": "of my extraordinary, ordinary life."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1891,
    "text": "Hello, you're down already. That's great. Thank you so much for that."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1892,
    "text": "And in we go."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1893,
    "text": "Posy? Posy!"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1894,
    "text": "That's fine."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1895,
    "text": "We're all travelling through time together"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1896,
    "text": "every day of our lives."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1897,
    "text": "All we can do is do our best"
  },
  {
    "idx": 1898,
    "text": "to relish this remarkable ride."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1899,
    "text": "Yes, yes, yes..."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1900,
    "text": "Okay, I'll see you then."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1901,
    "text": "Bye-bye."
  },
  {
    "idx": 1902,
    "text": "See you later."
  }
]